[{"id":"3b499b8","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-section rv-banner rv-banner--about","html_tag":"section","background_background":"classic","background_image":{"url":"https://ram-attorney.wsdfy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ram-v2-about-banner.jpg","id":147,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"background_position":"initial","background_xpos":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"background_ypos":{"unit":"%","size":40,"sizes":[]},"background_repeat":"no-repeat","background_size":"cover"},"elements":[{"id":"c624472","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-inner rv-banner-inner"},"elements":[{"id":"5e993b5","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"À PROPOS","header_size":"h1","_css_classes":"rv-banner-title"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"e7b8ab0","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-section rv-intro","html_tag":"section"},"elements":[{"id":"dad39b0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://ram-attorney.wsdfy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ram-v2-lady-justice.jpg","id":148,"alt":"","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","caption_source":"none","_css_classes":"rv-justice"},"elements":[]},{"id":"86c5737","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-inner rv-intro-wrap"},"elements":[{"id":"9866b83","elType":"widget","widgetType":"divider","settings":{"width":{"unit":"px","size":56,"sizes":[]},"weight":{"unit":"px","size":2,"sizes":[]},"color":"#B08D57","gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"sizes":[]},"_css_classes":"rv-rule rv-rule--short"},"elements":[]},{"id":"e6750b3","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-intro-grid"},"elements":[{"id":"b860b1f","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-col rv-col--text"},"elements":[{"id":"c961bcd","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Fondée en 1994 en tant qu'entreprise gérant principalement des artistes de l'industrie musicale et offrant des services juridiques à des entreprises et organisations du secteur, RAM Management a évolué et offre à présent des conseils juridiques à tous les domaines d'affaires.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-body"},"elements":[]},{"id":"9f5aa8a","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>RAM Management travaille en étroite collaboration avec les petites et moyennes entreprises, les aidant dans leurs relations contractuelles et commerciales ainsi que dans leur structure d'entreprise. Elle collabore également avec les propriétaires d'entreprise pour élaborer des stratégies visant à accroître la croissance et la valeur de leur entreprise.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-body"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"9ac0be6","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-col rv-col--text"},"elements":[{"id":"3267216","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Souvent sollicités pour engager des artistes américains au nom de nos clients canadiens pour leurs événements privés et corporatifs, nous avons commencé à aider certains de ces artistes à traiter leurs demandes d’exemptions fiscales canadiennes.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-body"},"elements":[]},{"id":"6d1bcf4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Appréciant notre travail, les artistes non-résidents ont commencé à engager directement RAM Management pour traiter les exemptions d'impôts pour toutes leurs performances au Canada; beaucoup de ces relations existent encore aujourd'hui.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-body"},"elements":[]}]}]}]}]},{"id":"f65444f","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-section rv-services","html_tag":"section"},"elements":[{"id":"5f26f9b","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-inner rv-services-inner"},"elements":[{"id":"e05d1bc","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Notre expertise s’étend aujourd’hui à tous les aspects de la conformité fiscale pour les artistes non-résidents ainsi que pour les entrepreneurs et fournisseurs qui travaillent sur leurs spectacles au Canada. Nous pouvons vous aider sur des questions telles que :</p>","_css_classes":"rv-services-lead"},"elements":[]},{"id":"e994263","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-cards"},"elements":[{"id":"acb93cd","elType":"widget","widgetType":"icon-box","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":{"url":"__ICON_waiver_URL__","id":"__ICON_waiver_ID__"},"library":"svg"},"title_text":"Dispenses des retenues à la source du Règlement 105 fédéral et Règlement 1016 du Québec","description_text":"","title_size":"div","position":"top","_css_classes":"rv-card"},"elements":[]},{"id":"10bc7a4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"icon-box","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":{"url":"__ICON_people_URL__","id":"__ICON_people_ID__"},"library":"svg"},"title_text":"Retenues R105 et Partie XIII pour les employés, entrepreneurs et fournisseurs","description_text":"","title_size":"div","position":"top","_css_classes":"rv-card"},"elements":[]},{"id":"efa14be","elType":"widget","widgetType":"icon-box","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":{"url":"__ICON_receipt_URL__","id":"__ICON_receipt_ID__"},"library":"svg"},"title_text":"Déclaration de revenus et déclaration d'information","description_text":"","title_size":"div","position":"top","_css_classes":"rv-card"},"elements":[]},{"id":"9100cfb","elType":"widget","widgetType":"icon-box","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":{"url":"__ICON_search_URL__","id":"__ICON_search_ID__"},"library":"svg"},"title_text":"Vérifications d'impôt sur le revenu et des retenues à la source","description_text":"","title_size":"div","position":"top","_css_classes":"rv-card"},"elements":[]},{"id":"79bc000","elType":"widget","widgetType":"icon-box","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":{"url":"__ICON_court_URL__","id":"__ICON_court_ID__"},"library":"svg"},"title_text":"Objections et autres représentations auprès de l'ARC et la Cour fiscale du Canada","description_text":"","title_size":"div","position":"top","_css_classes":"rv-card"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"a294ecc","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-section rv-quote","html_tag":"section","background_background":"classic","background_image":{"url":"https://ram-attorney.wsdfy.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/ram-v2-quote-canada-tax-fr.jpg","id":201,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"background_position":"initial","background_xpos":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"background_ypos":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"background_repeat":"no-repeat","background_size":"cover"},"elements":[{"id":"ef75c25","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-inner rv-quote-inner"},"elements":[{"id":"1a5dc54","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Au cours de la dernière décennie, nous avons été témoins de l'attention accrue portée par l'ARC aux artistes non-résidents et à leurs opérations, et nous croyons qu'il est plus important que jamais pour les non-résidents travaillant au Canada de s'assurer qu'ils respectent toutes leurs obligations fiscales canadiennes.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-quote-text"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"40cf0d3","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-section rv-team","html_tag":"section"},"elements":[{"id":"07a9c43","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-inner rv-team-inner"},"elements":[{"id":"4103ca2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>NOTRE ÉQUIPE</p>","_css_classes":"rv-pill rv-pill--team"},"elements":[]},{"id":"bb6fc55","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-team-grid rv-team-rows"},"elements":[{"id":"d40ced4","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member rv-member--row"},"elements":[{"id":"495f312","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member-side"},"elements":[{"id":"2677c28","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Richard Dermer","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"rv-member-name"},"elements":[]},{"id":"a916214","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Propriétaire</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-role"},"elements":[]},{"id":"bcf38aa","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><a href=\"mailto:richard@rammanagement.ca\">richard@rammanagement.ca</a></p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-email"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"c2dd0eb","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member-bio"},"elements":[{"id":"c2e8bd1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>RAM Management fut fondée par Richard Dermer, un résident de longue date de Montréal et propriétaire d'une petite entreprise lui-même de 1985 à 1994.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-text"},"elements":[]},{"id":"c574aab","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Richard a obtenu un baccalauréat en arts en histoire du Collège Vassar, puis un baccalauréat en droit civil de la faculté de droit de McGill et est devenu membre du barreau du Québec en 1994.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-text"},"elements":[]},{"id":"090813c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Richard a siégé au conseil d'administration et aux comités de divers organismes communautaires et a siégé au conseil d'administration et à l'exécutif de l'Association canadienne de production de disques indépendants de 2002 à 2008.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-text"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"7041570","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member rv-member--row"},"elements":[{"id":"c858a88","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member-side"},"elements":[{"id":"5860569","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Nadine Benny","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"rv-member-name"},"elements":[]},{"id":"db161d5","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Administration et directrice des services à la clientèle internationale</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-role"},"elements":[]},{"id":"f67b96f","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><a href=\"mailto:nadine@rammanagement.ca\">nadine@rammanagement.ca</a></p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-email"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"555a58f","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member-bio"},"elements":[{"id":"6847a1f","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Administration et directrice des services à la clientèle internationale Nadine Benny travaille chez RAM Management depuis plus de 20 ans. Diplômée de l'Université Concordia en 2005 avec un baccalauréat en commerce en marketing, Nadine a participé au programme de l'Institut d'éducation coopérative où elle a effectué des stages en publicité, gestion d'artistes et dans le secteur sans but lucratif. Pianiste formée en musique classique, Nadine a complété le programme du Conservatoire de musique de McGill en 1999. Nadine parle couramment le français et l’anglais et a complété un certificat en droit à l'Université de Montréal en 2011.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-text"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"551a722","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member rv-member--row"},"elements":[{"id":"b15c208","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member-side"},"elements":[{"id":"d0b0717","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Kayla Papps","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"rv-member-name"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ada6774","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Coordonnatrice des clients internationaux</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-role"},"elements":[]},{"id":"17809ea","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><a href=\"mailto:kayla@rammanagement.ca\">kayla@rammanagement.ca</a></p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-email"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"1f0433d","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","css_classes":"rv rv-member-bio"},"elements":[{"id":"7410360","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>La coordonnatrice des clients internationaux Kayla Papps a rejoint RAM Management peu après avoir obtenu son baccalauréat en psychologie de l'Université McGill en 2019. Kayla est devenue une partie intégrante de l'équipe, maintenant les relations avec les clients et gérant les subtilités des exigences de conformité en constante évolution de l'ARC.</p>","_css_classes":"rv-member-text"},"elements":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]
